*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# KIN license signing kit - offline kitchen only. Never ship the generator,
# private key, or issue ledger in the product repo. Keep a local copy of
# licensing-generator/ on the signing machine (gitignored entirely).
licensing-generator/

# Local visual design reference (Emergent mock, CRA + Tailwind). It is read
# for its look only, never built or shipped, and it carries demo logins and a
# mock store that must not reach production. Keep it local.
kin-mail-design01/

# Working notes for a multi-session task. Local scratch, not product docs.
WORKING-NOTES-*.md

# Handover material for another tool or another engineer. It is written for
# us, not for a customer: it names what is unfinished, what is untested, what
# we got wrong and had to fix, and how this company works. A product clone
# must not carry any of that. cursor-handover/ reached both public remotes in
# d62cf6c on 11 Sep 2026 before this rule existed; keep copies on the
# workstation only.
cursor-handover/
*-HANDOVER-*.md
HANDOVER*.md

# Temporary visual harness for rendering a page against stubbed fetch data.
# Created and deleted per session; it stubs the API and must never ship.
console/frontend/preview.html
console/frontend/src/preview.tsx

# Output of check-unattended-install.sh: the config keys read out of the
# Zimbra build being deployed. Regenerated per build, not product source.
zmsetup-config-keys.txt
